### Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "Nighttime Urban Roundabout with Fog" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :EvidenceBasedAnomaly ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1, :risk2 ;
    :hasEvidence :evidence1 .

:weather1 a :FoggyCondition ;
    :description "Heavy fog reducing visibility in urban roundabout" .

:evidence1 a :FallingObjectIndicator ;
    :description "Fog particles creating visual noise and obscuring road markings" ;
    :indicatesPotentialRisk :risk1 .

:risk1 a :OcclusionRisk ;
    :description "Reduced visibility due to fog obscuring road users and obstacles" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.92"^^xsd:float .

:risk2 a :WeatherRisk ;
    :description "Foggy conditions increasing collision likelihood" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.88"^^xsd:float .
```

